# Upload budget (ADR 0050; ADR 0026 shapes). Only a ServerAdmin reads or changes it.

"""
The server's internet upload speed, as a ServerAdmin enters it from a speed test. It is off by default.
While it is on, the stream sessions that count against the upload budget may use streamSharePercent of the
upload speed together. A stream session counts at the average bitrate of what it sends: its measured average
once the bitrate scan has run, otherwise its probed average, and an encoded variant at its target average. A
stream session that its client attests it reached over the local network never counts, and neither does a
suspended one. The budget never refuses playback, never changes direct play and never forces an encode. It only
leaves variants out of an HLS stream session's multivariant playlist when they would take the counted stream
sessions over the share. The playlist always keeps its lowest variant. The check runs when the playlist is
served and reserves nothing, so the budget is a soft cap.
"""
type UploadBudgetSetting {
    "The internet upload speed in megabits per second, or null while the upload budget is off."
    internetUploadMegabitsPerSecond: Int
    "The percentage of the internet upload speed that counted stream sessions may use together."
    streamSharePercent: Int!
    """
    The megabits per second that counted stream sessions may use together: streamSharePercent of
    internetUploadMegabitsPerSecond. Null while the upload budget is off.
    """
    streamShareMegabitsPerSecond: Float
    "The lowest internet upload speed in megabits per second that a ServerAdmin can enter."
    minimumInternetUploadMegabitsPerSecond: Int!
    "The highest internet upload speed in megabits per second that a ServerAdmin can enter."
    maximumInternetUploadMegabitsPerSecond: Int!
}

input ChangeUploadBudgetInput {
    "The internet upload speed in megabits per second, from a speed test. Null turns the upload budget off."
    internetUploadMegabitsPerSecond: Int
}

type ChangeUploadBudgetPayload {
    uploadBudgetSetting: UploadBudgetSetting
    userErrors: [ChangeUploadBudgetError!]!
}

union ChangeUploadBudgetError = UploadBudgetOutOfRangeError
